---

---

<section
  class="relative border-b border-v3-border bg-v3-surface/40 py-14 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 overflow-hidden"
>
  <!-- Poświata pod kodem QR -->
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-v3-lime/5 blur-3xl"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Lewa kolumna: Informacje o aplikacji -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-v3-lime/30 bg-v3-lime/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-v3-lime"
        >
          <span>Wejście 5:00 – 24:00</span>
        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold uppercase leading-none text-white"
        >
          Wstęp na Smartfon <br /><span class="text-v3-lime"
            >Klub Bez Ograniczeń</span
          >
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-normal text-zinc-300 max-w-xl"
        >
          Centrum Sportowe V3 działa w standardzie samoobsługowym. Pobierz
          bezpłatną aplikację klubową <strong>GymManager</strong>, aktywuj
          karnet w kilka sekund i wchodź do klubu o dowolnej porze przy użyciu
          cyfrowego kodu QR na kołowrotku.
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-200">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-v3-lime/20 text-xs font-bold text-v3-lime"
              >✓</span
            >
            <span
              >Błyskawiczne otwieranie wejścia kodem QR z ekranu telefonu</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-v3-lime/20 text-xs font-bold text-v3-lime"
              >✓</span
            >
            <span
              >Zapisy na zajęcia grupowe, cross oraz fitness w 1 kliknięcie</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-v3-lime/20 text-xs font-bold text-v3-lime"
              >✓</span
            >
            <span>Wygodne odnawianie członkostwa i podgląd historii wejść</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://v3klub.gymmanager.io"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-v3-lime px-6 py-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-black transition hover:bg-v3-lime-hover shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(200,255,0,0.25)]"
          >
            Panel Klienta Online →
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://apps.apple.com/pl/app/gymmanager/id1453912648"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-v3-card px-4 py-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200 hover:border-v3-lime/40 hover:text-white transition"
          >
            <span>App Store</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=io.gymmanager.mobile"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-v3-card px-4 py-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200 hover:border-v3-lime/40 hover:text-white transition"
          >
            <span>Google Play</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Prawa kolumna: Karta QR -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div
          class="relative w-full max-w-sm rounded-3xl border border-v3-border bg-v3-surface/90 p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-md text-center shadow-xl"
        >
          <span
            class="inline-block rounded-full bg-v3-lime/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-v3-lime mb-4"
          >
            Kod QR Klubu
          </span>

          <div
            class="mx-auto w-44 h-44 rounded-2xl bg-white p-3 shadow-inner flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <!-- Dynamiczny kod QR linkujący do platformy GymManager -->
            <img
              src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=200x200&data=https://v3klub.gymmanager.io"
              alt="Kod QR do rejestracji w V3 Klub"
              width="170"
              height="170"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain"
            />
          </div>

          <p
            class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white leading-none"
          >
            Zeskanuj i dołącz
          </p>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-xs text-zinc-400">
            Skieruj aparat telefonu, aby otworzyć panel rejestracji
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
